ural disasters"},{"text":"Cyber risk"},{"text":"Currency risk"},{"text":"Single-source dependency"},{"text":"Capacity risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Probability × Impact × Exposure"},{"type":"p","text":"to structure risk prioritisation."},{"type":"h","text":"ERP and supply-chain technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Oracle"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics"},{"text":"WMS"},{"text":"TMS"},{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"Procurement systems"},{"text":"Order-management systems"},{"text":"Supply-chain control towers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For entry level, understanding the business process and data flow is more important than knowing every ERP transaction."},{"type":"h","text":"Projects to build during B.Com"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Inventory optimisation dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dataset containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Warehouse"},{"text":"Opening stock"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Purchases"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Reorder point"},{"text":"Safety stock"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Stock-out risk"},{"text":"Excess inventory"},{"text":"Reorder recommendations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create the dashboard in Power BI."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Demand forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Use historical product sales."},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical demand","Trend","Seasonality","Forecast","Forecast error"]},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Moving average"},{"text":"Weighted moving average"},{"text":"Exponential smoothing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then recommend inventory levels."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Supplier performance dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier"},{"text":"Purchase orders"},{"text":"Delivery dates"},{"text":"Actual delivery"},{"text":"Defe